  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Magnitude of magnetic field (in SI units) at the centre of a hexagonal shape coil of side&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn></math> turns and carrying current<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp; (Ampere) in units of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math> is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The magnetic field due to the current-carrying finite length wire is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Here for hexagonal shape coil,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.</p><p>So, the net magnetic field at the centre&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1500</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>500</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}